'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

==Description==
{{quote|During the assault on the TerraGroup office, a massive explosion erupted on top of one of the nearby high-rises. I got left on my own, with no contact with command. Looks like I'll have to handle the evacuation myself. But first things first, I have to get out of this Ground Zero.}}

==Requirements==
This chapter gets automatically added to the quest list upon starting the game.

==Objectives==
* Escape [[Ground Zero]]
* Talk to [[Therapist]]
* Ensure access to the [[Streets of Tarkov]]
** Hand over the cash to [[Therapist]]
** (''Optional'') Collect the required 250,000 [[Roubles]]
* Talk to [[Ragman]]
* Survive and extract from [[Interchange]] or visit [[Interchange]] 3 times
* Tell [[Ragman]] what you found during the recon
* Talk to [[Skier]]
* Survive and extract from [[Customs]] or visit [[Customs]] 3 times
* Hand over any 5 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] building materials items to [[Skier]]
** (''Optional'') Find any 5 items [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] from the building materials category
* Talk to [[Mechanic]]
* Survive and extract from [[Factory]] or visit [[Factory]] 3 times
* Hand over any 2 found [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]] [[weapons]] to [[Mechanic]]
** (''Optional'') Find any 2 [[weapons]] [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]]
* Talk to [[Skier]]
* Eliminate any 3 targets on [[Woods]]
* Survive and extract from [[Woods]] or visit [[Woods]] 3 times
* Locate the entrance to the port Terminal
* Find a way to contact the soldiers at the Terminal
* Use the intercom to contact the port garrison
* Learn how to escape Tarkov
* Ensure access to [[Reserve]]
** Survive and extract from [[Shoreline]] or visit [[Shoreline]] 3 times
** Hand over 5 [[Dogtag|PMC dogtag]]s to [[Prapor]]
** (''Optional'') Find 5 [[Dogtag|PMC dogtag]]s [[Found in raid|<font color="red">in raid</font>]]
* Ensure access to [[Lighthouse]]
** Hand over 8,000 [[Dollars|USD]] to [[Mechanic]]
** (''Optional'') Collect the required 8,000 [[Dollars|USD]]
* Ensure access to [[The Lab]]
** Access the secret [[The Lab|TerraGroup facility]]
** (''Optional'') Obtain a [[TerraGroup Labs access keycard|keycard]] or access codes to enter the [[The Lab|facility]]
** (''Optional'') Locate the entrance to the [[The Lab|facility]] on [[Factory]]
** (''Optional'') Locate the entrance to the [[The Lab|facility]] on [[Streets of Tarkov]]
** Search the top management offices in [[The Lab]]
** Search the server room in [[The Lab]]
** Locate the escape path through the drainage system in [[The Lab]]

==Guide==
===Escape Ground Zero===
Finish the tutorial raid by extracting via the "Klimov Street" extraction which is located behind the "Skyside" business center. During the tutorial, numerous hints on controls and game mechanics are displayed, but none of them need to be followed in order to complete the raid.
