One of the following two [[transits]] has to be used to access [[The Lab]]:
====[[Streets of Tarkov]] to [[The Lab]]====
Underground entrance in front of the Klimova 16A building with the Cosmonaut painting. [[TerraGroup Labs access keycard]] required. Transits are only available 1 min after raid start.
